# Justine: all four maps in a row on foot, with real actions (PlayerSimulation script, see
# docs/ScriptPort/justine/walkthrough.md). Start: maps/ptest/01_cells.map, without -scriptDebug, with -noEnemyAI.
# Route: Victor dies (lever), Hector and Felix are saved.

# ---- 01_cells: the intro, the phonograph lowers the lantern, its pickup opens the cell door.
watch 40 20
walkto phonograph_1
aim phonograph_1
interact
mouse 3 0 1
mouse 0 3 1
mouse -3 0 1
mouse 0 -3 1
release
watch 6 6
pick lantern_1
watch 4 4
# Three pulls bang the hatch open; the third rolls the ladder down and kills Victor.
pull lever_simple01_1 1
watch 3 3
pull lever_simple01_1 1
watch 3 3
pull lever_simple01_1 1
watch 12 12
climb LadderArea_1
watch 2 2
# The loft tunnel ends at a drop (falls up to 25 m allowed), then the corridors to the library door.
walkto level_wood_1 25
door level_wood_1

# ---- 02_library: stencils 4 and 3 in the slots save Hector, the secret shelf opens the way down.
watch 3 3
pick stencil04
pick stencil03
use stencil04 AreaCardSlot_01
use stencil03 AreaCardSlot_02
pull slot_machine_1 1
watch 10 10
door level_celler_1

# ---- 03_dungeon: the lever handle, the cogwheel for the machine, the prisoner's door, the exit door.
watch 5 5
pick slide_door01_lever_handle
use slide_door01_lever_handle PuzzleOpenDoor01_StickyArea
watch 1 1
pull slide_door01_fixedlever
watch 6 6
carry elevator_cogwheel01_1 PuzzleSlideDoor02_CogSticky
watch 3 3
pull slide_door02_lever_open -1
watch 6 6
# The valve lowers Felix's door (saved), the other one raises the exit door.
wheel valve_iron_rusty02_2 -1 4
watch 2 2
wheel valve_iron_rusty02_1 1 6
watch 3 3
walkto PlayerStartArea_5
pull slide_door03_lever_close 1
watch 6 6
door level_dungeon_2

# ---- 04_final: the graves and the maze on the way, the crush room (pass out, wake up), Clarice, the end.
watch 5 5
walkto Area_CrushRoom
watch 160 20
walkto AreaClarice_1
watch 70 10
credits
call GetGlobalVarInt VictorIsDead
call GetGlobalVarInt HectorIsDead
call GetGlobalVarInt FelixIsDead
health
